Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你昨晚守夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for keeping watch last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's nothing. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你来守吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you can keep watch tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今天会有收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna win today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也需要给那个对讲机找电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need batteries for that walkie, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它重新开始工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.47,0:01:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's that smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出来几天了  结果只找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of days out, all we got to show are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多两把枪  几个压扁的豆子罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}two guns, dented cans of beans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和几件球衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some football jerseys, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fightin' the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:11.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我再听见关于肥乔的一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I hear one more goddamn word about Fat Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就打碎某人的牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna smash somebody's teeth in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看是甩掉了累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good riddance to dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算没什么狗屁吉祥物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more mascot crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:42.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对椒盐脆饼的品位不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got good taste in pretzels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}And batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.81,0:02:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天了  我们得回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days. We're gonna need to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再过一天半  今天和明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day and a half more -- today and tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以再出来  我们应该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can come out again. We should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:08.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再转会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没必要现在就找到武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to find them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再转转吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正想来拆线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I was just coming over to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.91,0:04:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹妮斯教过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise showed me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弄完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思  塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What -- What does that even mean, Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是我们现在有足够的人手去战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we've got the numbers to fight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.01,0:04:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只用找一些枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need to find some guns and --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们今天能在哪找到这么多枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where we could find that many guns today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周呢  今年呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This week? This year?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.29,0:05:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就这样等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你  但我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到枪的  好吗  我们会战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find the guns, okay? And we're gonna fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肯定不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's not gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像上次哨站那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the last time at the outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:25.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你可以省点脾气跟他们打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe you could just save all this for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:32.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮你的伤疤愈合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help with your scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:43.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:06:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:03.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你一头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you a deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}From before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:09.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时他们在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they were outside the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:27.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种枪就是我们出来要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's guns like that. That's why we're out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里发生了惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something serious happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这些子弹很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. These are serious rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这里也有好枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be serious guns here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们仔细瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a better look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:14.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们不该在这里待太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we shouldn't be up here too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看看有什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see what we're gonna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,士兵  平民  这些子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers, civilians, all those rounds --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾有一场恶战\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是别的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还背着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still wearing their guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得就是这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:57.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得我们可以搞定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we can?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-Yeah. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个预兆  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is -- This is a sign, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it. It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh-ho. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(即食口粮)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是即食的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.87,0:13:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没找到枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't find any guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you were wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:09.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在外面找了一整天  一把都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out there all day and not a damn one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.07,0:13:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一把真枪都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:15.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  我之前有一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, I had a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来打算用它杀了尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna use it to kill Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.99,0:13:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我当时成功了  像我计划中的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I had done it, like I'd planned to,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:25.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那如今尼根已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan would be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  也许我也会死  但谁他妈在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yeah, maybe I'd be dead, too, but who gives a damn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话尤金就不会被抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene would still be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚会还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯宾塞也会还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如今他们都不在了  而我却还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they're gone, and I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:47.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为我愚蠢地听信了你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I was stupid enough to listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也照做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就站在那里对别人指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand there telling people about their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只对那些来这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if they come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know shit about shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.03,0:14:17.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过你不应该去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that you weren't supposed to die
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不应该去做那件你计划要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that you shouldn't do the thing that you were planning to do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we needed you --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们如今依然需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我这样的傻瓜都能看清那一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even a fool like me could see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了的确会更容易些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easier to be dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:40.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你还活着是我的错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if it's my fault you're alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我只能背负着这个错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I'm just gonna have to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时决定要插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to meddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我做的是我认为正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did something I thought was right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道这事风险很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I knew the stakes were very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然可以因为自己还活着而指责我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can certainly blame me for the fact that you have a life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:58.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但之后呢  你要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}but after that what are you going to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要如何促成那些必须得发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you going to make what needs to happen happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你心跳停止之前  一切皆有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything is possible until your heart stops beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能做的绝不仅仅是冲着个傻子大吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly more than yelling at a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:41.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(美国政府财产  严禁商业转售)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.11,0:15:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(即食口粮  7号菜单  牛腩配肉汁)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(火鸡胸肉)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:15:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  明天...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们出去  把武器抢回来  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we go out there, we get the weapons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:15.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后让简迪斯和她的人和我们一起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get Jadis and her people to fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们杀死尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill Negan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.27,0:16:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及其他该杀之人  来赢得战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and anyone else we have to to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后  我们继续生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, we keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:33.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根用他的方法统治世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan ordered the world his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死之后  我们应该建立新秩序  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to us to reorder it once he's gone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.49,0:16:42.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the different communities,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以一起想办法  谈论如何继续生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can figure it out together, how to keep going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但总得有人促成这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but somebody's gonna have to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人负责  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody will need to be in charge of that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人应该是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是我  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not me. - ‭Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以胜任的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭You'd be good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if it's something that you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想做  也不愿意做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't think I do. Or I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果是咱们俩  你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the two of us, you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起重建秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}reordering things together...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你也愿意的话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's something you wanted....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要再吃五包这个  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna eat five more of these dinners, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们用不着明天就搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't have to get it done tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以悠闲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.76,0:18:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过一两天再走也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go another day, another one after that, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  这地方没危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the place is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严严实实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:25.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一条路能进来  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the only way in, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然能拿到枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're getting the guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多花点时间也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't matter if it takes a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:38.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I've been, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在等着给你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting to show you this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是  辣椒  奶酪意面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um, chili and mac and cheese...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.55,0:18:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大杂烩\N{\fnArial\fs30}together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:52.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.39,0:19:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:19:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}W..you...you want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.63,0:20:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:10.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是别人送我的  曾经帮助过我的某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone gave it to me, someone who helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为我不顾一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}She put her ass on the line for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她救了我的命  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved my life, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她本来不用的  但却做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't have to. But she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今这样做是有意义的  毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means something now -- it does. It has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我说了  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I say something, you know --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿不到枪  瑞克是不会离开那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick won't leave there without their guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我们能成功接近那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If -- if we could even get close enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:39.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们也会开火  我们会反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll start firing, and we'll fire back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:45.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们应该跟我们并肩战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they should just fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军杀了她们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors killed their fathers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,儿子和兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their sons and their brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她们不会想和我们并肩战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't want to fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们只想藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just want to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她们只能和我们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they'll just fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:07.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我告诉大家海边旅馆的事  就会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell everyone about Oceanside, that's what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么我们的命比他们的更珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes our life worth more than theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.14,0:21:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为我们想阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we want to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些伤害我们的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people that are hurting us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.69,0:21:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些会伤害别人的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who will hurt other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.76,0:22:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸在外游荡  没有被关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkers in the field, they're not closed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:25.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得干掉外面的这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to take care of the ones out here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:28.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把缺口堵上  然后再慢慢干掉剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and block that gap, too, so we can take the rest slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:33.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七  八...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven, eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:36.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:41.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆车  我能堵上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That car -- I can block it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能干掉挡路的那一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take out that one on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把剩下的引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You draw the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我留了八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're leaving me eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.17,0:22:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以朝它们开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could shoot them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这样会引来剩余的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that would call the rest from the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得悄悄行动  用剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about doing it quiet, with the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:22:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八个对你来说不是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can handle eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:42.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经干掉八个行尸了  我推得动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your eight walkers. I can push.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.62,0:24:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.13,0:24:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要负责把车开到缺口那儿就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just worry about steering us in that gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.58,0:24:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刹车坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brakes don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.33,0:25:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.19,0:25:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们开过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we overshot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得还是你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think or you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.36,0:25:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.79,0:25:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这个计划是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a good plan, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.79,0:25:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个计划超棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.65,0:26:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.67,0:26:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.07,0:26:24.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  这拦不住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. It's not gonna hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.76,0:26:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.55,0:27:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们散开  减少它们的数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split them off into smaller groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.74,0:27:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,栅栏也许能挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}The barriers might hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.55,0:27:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去滑梯  我去摩天轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take slide, I take Ferris wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.82,0:27:20.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们可以逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想逃吗  - 不  我们能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to go?  - Nah. We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.52,0:28:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那边如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还剩八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight more!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.34,0:28:28.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.39,0:28:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十个\N{\fnArial\fs30}10!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.99,0:29:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.84,0:29:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.91,0:31:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.78,0:31:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试过了  但我还欠你一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, but I still owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.33,0:33:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在外面多待几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've gone a couple more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.50,0:33:36.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've liked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.08,0:33:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.78,0:33:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想着我们失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about what we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.56,0:34:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想着我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦救过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.50,0:34:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最开始的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.71,0:34:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我没能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.74,0:34:14.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.00,0:34:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.57,0:34:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being stuck on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.08,0:34:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们经历了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went through something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.85,0:34:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光这样是不能释怀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- This doesn't cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.75,0:34:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.99,0:34:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要反抗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.03,0:34:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是接下来会发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.50,0:34:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会失去一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna lose people,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.67,0:34:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是很多人  也许是对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe a lot of them, maybe even each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.48,0:34:57.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使那样  也值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even then, it'll be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.35,0:35:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我想到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I thought that...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.49,0:35:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.33,0:35:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.73,0:35:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃投降算怎么个活法\N{\fnArial\fs30}what kind of life we had just surrendering.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.25,0:35:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't -- It wasn't a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.22,0:35:25.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在那里做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we did back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:28.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we're doing now,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.21,0:35:32.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为朱迪思拼未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}making a future for Judith
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.71,0:35:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为格伦和玛姬的孩子拼未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for Glenn and Maggie's baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.31,0:35:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出抗争  这才叫生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting the fight, that's living.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.64,0:35:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你让我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You showed me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.26,0:35:43.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以失去我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can lose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.01,0:35:44.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - ‭Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.89,0:35:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也可以失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.50,0:35:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以失去朋友  爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can lose our friends, people we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不再是关乎我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.93,0:35:57.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是关乎未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.49,0:36:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it's me who doesn't make it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.03,0:36:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就必须带领其他人前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna have to lead the others forward
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.21,0:36:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你有这能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're the one who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.97,0:36:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.50,0:36:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.70,0:36:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带我走到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you led me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.19,0:36:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都能用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operational? All?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.72,0:36:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我说知  能\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the best of my knowledge, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.38,0:36:39.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能需要清理一下  我们找到了物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}May need some cleaning. We found supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我们清理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.32,0:36:44.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们清理了一部分  上了油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cleaned some. We oiled some.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的你们来  我们是合作关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do the rest. We do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.82,0:36:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  但能用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, but operational?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.31,0:36:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以开几枪试试  如果你想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can fire a few. Try them out, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多少把  -63把\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many? - 63.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.22,0:36:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做了清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made an inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.11,0:36:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.85,0:37:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说不要清单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the inventory?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.43,0:37:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不够  -你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not enough. - ‭What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.73,0:37:06.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要很多枪  这就是很多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for a lot of guns. That's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.09,0:37:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要为你战斗  我们需要两倍的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to fight your fight. Us? Nearly twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.55,0:37:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要两倍的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need nearly twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.86,0:37:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们浪费够多时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've wasted enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.13,0:37:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  带上枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Take our guns with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.52,0:37:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.92,0:37:18.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的枪  协议还没结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our guns to take. Our deal still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.19,0:37:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能全拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.13,0:37:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们留十把  为了找更多的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're keeping 10 for ourselves -- to find more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.68,0:37:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.53,0:37:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-十把  -六把\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 10. - ‭6.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-十把  -九把\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 10. - ‭9.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且要归还猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the cat back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.24,0:37:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二十把  猫归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}20. I keep the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给你找到枪  然后一起战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get you the guns. We fight together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.33,0:37:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.11,0:37:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:51.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽快拿来更多枪  我们就战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More soon, we'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.77,0:38:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再多等几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a few more days
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.85,0:38:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"接下来的事"就会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}before "What happens next."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再多等几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.28,0:38:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.97,0:38:32.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到更多枪  想办法解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find more, figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.22,0:38:34.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.64,0:38:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再多等几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.33,0:39:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.46,0:39:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我只是...正准备去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I was just -- I was just coming over to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.84,0:39:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.38,0:39:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见到罗西塔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen Rosita?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.72,0:39:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早换岗她不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't show for her guard shift this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.17,0:39:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她大概出去找枪了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She probably just went out looking for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.67,0:39:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.00,0:39:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.82,0:39:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you coming by?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.03,0:39:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要告诉你一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.58,0:40:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.29,0:40:12.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里是找你帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.36,0:40:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}One condition --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.22,0:40:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要由我杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:34.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.94,0:40:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带桥上的炸药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you bring any explosives from the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.90,0:40:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我考虑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.26,0:40:44.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想被别人发现和阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't want anyone finding out and trying to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.17,0:40:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带了更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something better, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就能杀他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can take your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克和米琼恩找到了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and Michonne found guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.87,0:41:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们没准备好行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they aren't ready to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.93,0:41:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.73,0:41:25.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们需要更多枪  更多人  更多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The need more guns, more people, more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.87,0:41:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更多借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}more excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.18,0:41:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记下了达里尔和卡尔给瑞克说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I memorized everything Daryl and Carl told Rick
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.97,0:41:33.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根基地内部情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the inside of Negan's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.15,0:41:37.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣给我画了一张外围的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus made me a map of the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.10,0:41:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常远  守卫森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's far away. It's well-defended.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.59,0:41:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只有我们两个人  -你要改主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only two of us. You changing your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.64,0:41:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好杀他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.82,0:41:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我要确认你知道这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to make sure you know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.35,0:41:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.86,0:41:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能活捉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't catch us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.17,0:41:57.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果被抓住  就给了他们借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they do, we give them something.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.97,0:42:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这是有去无回\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a one-way ticket for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.15,0:42:04.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们都去的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.82,0:42:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
